<section class="spx-page-hero"><div class="container spx-split"><div><span class="spx-kicker">About Culltron Smart Port Flow</span><h1>Enterprise AI operations prototype for smarter port flow</h1><p>The product demonstrates how AI-assisted recommendations can become auditable execution across control-room teams, fleet owners and drivers without overstating live integration.</p><a href="/demo-access" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-btn--lg">Open Demo Access</a></div><div class="spx-map-visual spx-map-visual--compact"><div class="spx-map-grid"></div><div class="spx-container-stack"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section spx-section--deep"><div class="container spx-split"><div class="spx-glow-card"><span class="spx-kicker">Mission</span><h2>Reduce idle time through coordinated execution</h2><p>Smart Port turns congestion signals into clear truck actions: hold, stage, proceed, reschedule, report an issue or complete. Drivers receive status and instructions through web, Android and WhatsApp-ready channels.</p></div><div class="spx-glow-card"><span class="spx-kicker">Architecture</span><h2>Built for pilot integration</h2><p>The ASP.NET Core backend, PostgreSQL data model and integration services are designed for approved pilot connectors to TOS/IPMS, gate, berth, yard, fleet, WhatsApp Cloud API and AI providers.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section"><div class="container"><div class="spx-section__head"><span class="spx-kicker">Honest scope</span><h2>What the prototype does and does not claim</h2><p>Demo mode uses synthetic operational data. It is integration-ready for real keys and controlled pilot feeds, but no live port/IPMS/TOS, production GPS tracking or SMS capability is claimed.</p></div></div></section>
